<title>USA: AMBAC announces secondary market insurance.</title>
<headline>AMBAC announces secondary market insurance.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ambac Assurance Corp. has secondary insurance capacity for:</p>
<p>--Battery Park senior and junior lein.</p>
<p>--Philadelphia Gas.</p>
<p>--Detriot GOs.</p>
<p>--New York Local Government Assistance Corp.</p>
<p>--Calif. Health for Kaiser Permanente.</p>
<p>--Puerto Rico GOs.</p>
<p>--Puerto Rico Aquaduct GOs.</p>
<p>For further details, please call 212-480-3600</p>
</text>
